# Deployment Guardrail

- Do not run production deployment commands unless the user explicitly asks to deploy.
- Treat code/content edits, local verification, lint, and build as separate from deployment.
- Commands such as `npx vercel --prod --yes`, `vercel deploy --prod`, production alias promotion, or production publish steps require an explicit user request in the current conversation.
